{"2193790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vtopia", "steam_appid": 2193790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/5ab119969ed9648aaa39156efaa1f27e.poster.avif?t=1786933757\" width=1050 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/5ab119969ed9648aaa39156efaa1f27e.webm?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/5ab119969ed9648aaa39156efaa1f27e.mp4?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In VTOPIA, you enter a fully editable voxel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the surface, underground, and dangerous dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cities, reshape terrain, and even control liquids and gases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no limits—only your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/d3d2dfab09a1d9c0c9ff250b78771baa.poster.avif?t=1786933757\" width=1050 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/d3d2dfab09a1d9c0c9ff250b78771baa.webm?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/d3d2dfab09a1d9c0c9ff250b78771baa.mp4?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo, or build your world with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperate, compete, or just mess around.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine together, play cards…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>or kick your friend into lava (your choice).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/7b7dfea6264325730233672101dc9b04.poster.avif?t=1786933757\" width=1050 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/7b7dfea6264325730233672101dc9b04.webm?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/7b7dfea6264325730233672101dc9b04.mp4?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are more than mindless targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can be clever, unpredictable… or hilariously dumb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face them with a wide range of weapons and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature drops unique rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/15f3feccfd01445159700c8a0987bce3.poster.avif?t=1786933757\" width=1050 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/15f3feccfd01445159700c8a0987bce3.webm?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/15f3feccfd01445159700c8a0987bce3.mp4?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet villagers with their own personalities and stories.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade, relax, and build a place to call home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn a small settlement into a thriving town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They grow with you—as neighbors, or even friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/5bf1eac7ac8c6f2ebab982b1f8b8d47c.poster.avif?t=1786933757\" width=1050 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/5bf1eac7ac8c6f2ebab982b1f8b8d47c.webm?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/5bf1eac7ac8c6f2ebab982b1f8b8d47c.mp4?t=1786933757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change everything. Create anything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in editors for voxels, pixels, dialogue, AI behavior, maps, and music.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No coding required.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create mods as easily as filling out a form.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the same tools as the developers—and build your own game inside the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193790/extras/5ab119969ed9648aaa39156efaa1f27e.poster.avif?t=1786933757\" width=1050 height=400 ><source 